    "Node name for S&R": "Note"
   },
   "widgets_values": [
    "MENU DE ALTERNATIVAS - copia y pega\n\nCAJA 2 - CAPA (color y tela)\n- deep crimson wool cloak billowing violently in the wind\n- torn black wool cloak whipping in the wind\n- deep royal blue cloak with gold embroidered border\n- bleached white linen cloak stained with dust and blood\n- dark green cloak heavy with rain\n\nCAJA 3 - ARMA Y ESCUDO\n- battle-worn bronze hoplon shield and long ash spear\n- large round bronze shield with a painted lambda symbol and a short xiphos sword\n- cracked wooden shield and a heavy iron mace\n- no shield, gripping two short blades\n- tall tower shield and a long pike\n\nCAJA 5 - CIELO, LUZ Y AMBIENTE\n- dramatic golden backlight from the rising sun behind his silhouette, volumetric god rays cutting through haze, swirling dust and glowing embers in the air, distant storm clouds over the aegean sea\n- cold blue moonlight, thin fog rolling over the rocks, faint stars in a clear night sky\n- blood red sunset, thick black smoke from distant fires, ash falling like snow\n- heavy grey rain, wet bronze reflecting a dull sky, lightning on the horizon\n- bright harsh midday sun, sharp black shadows, dry dust in the air\n\nCAJA 6 - COLOR Y OPTICA (el look de cine)\n- teal and orange color grading, high contrast chiaroscuro lighting, anamorphic lens flare, shallow depth of field, 35mm anamorphic film, heavy film grain\n- desaturated bleach bypass look, muted greens and greys, harsh contrast, 16mm film grain\n- warm golden sepia tones, soft glowing highlights, vintage lens bloom\n- cold steel blue monochrome, minimal color, high contrast\n\nCONSEJO\nCambia solo UNA caja por vez. Si cambias tres a la vez\nno sabras cual fue la que mejoro o empeoro la imagen."
   ],
   "title": "MENU DE ALTERNATIVAS",
